WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.750 --> 00:00:01.583
This is the craziest experience

00:00:01.583 --> 00:00:03.706
because we're doing this over Zoom.

00:00:03.706 --> 00:00:06.199
You are not in the room with
me because of this virus

00:00:06.199 --> 00:00:07.610
that I just heard about-

00:00:07.610 --> 00:00:09.980
But you're in the room with me.

00:00:09.980 --> 00:00:10.813
You know how?

00:00:10.813 --> 00:00:11.646
How?

00:00:14.390 --> 00:00:15.510
Oh, that's nice.

00:00:15.510 --> 00:00:16.533
Look at that!

00:00:17.430 --> 00:00:18.437
I wrote you a letter.

00:00:18.437 --> 00:00:20.540
This is my letter from Conan O'Brien.

00:00:20.540 --> 00:00:21.476
Yeah!

00:00:21.476 --> 00:00:24.067
Who writes letters, ladies and gentlemen.

00:00:24.067 --> 00:00:27.370
I wrote you a letter
when your book came out-

00:00:27.370 --> 00:00:28.580
And went to it, man.

00:00:28.580 --> 00:00:29.506
[Conan] Yeah.

00:00:29.506 --> 00:00:30.339
It's wonderful.

00:00:30.339 --> 00:00:32.350
I wrote you a letter and your framed it.

00:00:32.350 --> 00:00:33.183
I framed it.

00:00:33.183 --> 00:00:34.380
But here's the crazy thing,

00:00:34.380 --> 00:00:35.700
it's COVID, right?

00:00:35.700 --> 00:00:36.533
Yeah.

00:00:36.533 --> 00:00:37.560
So, I'm doing all my own framing.

00:00:37.560 --> 00:00:39.176
So, check out the edge on it.

00:00:39.176 --> 00:00:40.248
It's really-

00:00:40.248 --> 00:00:41.266
(laughing)

00:00:41.266 --> 00:00:43.972
I did it with an X-Acto knife.

00:00:43.972 --> 00:00:45.820
I don't think you can see it,

00:00:45.820 --> 00:00:47.977
but it's really uneven and horrible.

00:00:47.977 --> 00:00:48.810
Oh. That looks-

00:00:48.810 --> 00:00:49.900
That's how all my pictures are gonna be

00:00:49.900 --> 00:00:50.993
in the house from now on.

00:00:50.993 --> 00:00:52.340
It looks terrible.

00:00:52.340 --> 00:00:53.836
You know, it was funny because-

00:00:53.836 --> 00:00:55.439
Cuomo didn't think of that.

00:00:55.439 --> 00:00:56.951
He never thought of that.

00:00:56.951 --> 00:00:58.820
He never envisioned it,

00:00:58.820 --> 00:01:01.162
that people would have crooked framing.

00:01:01.162 --> 00:01:03.089
(laughing) Wouldn't it be pompous

00:01:03.089 --> 00:01:06.440
if I had sent you that
letter already framed.

00:01:06.440 --> 00:01:07.860
Like, my assumption was

00:01:07.860 --> 00:01:09.493
that it would mean that
much to you, and if-

00:01:09.493 --> 00:01:10.583
It is gold.

00:01:10.583 --> 00:01:13.110
Yes, if whenever I sent anybody a letter,

00:01:13.110 --> 00:01:14.600
because it was coming from me,

00:01:14.600 --> 00:01:16.150
I sent it framed.

00:01:16.150 --> 00:01:17.250
What if I did that?

00:01:17.250 --> 00:01:18.899
And that was just my thing that I did.

00:01:18.899 --> 00:01:20.260
I think that'd be wonderful.

00:01:20.260 --> 00:01:21.232
[Conan] Yeah, and it was like-

00:01:21.232 --> 00:01:22.317
With a lock of your hair in it.

00:01:22.317 --> 00:01:25.793
(laughing) Exactly.

